    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d2">

                <pb facs="0071" n="1" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv01/pg1"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source"> Edward M. House Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Special Representative</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >House</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to President Wilson </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-11">November 11,
                            1918</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>13. Autocracy is dead. Long live democracy and its immortal leader. In this great
                    hour my heart goes out to you in pride, admiration and love.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Edward House</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
